- **Combined Velocity Checks**: Additional checks for combined effects of cart velocity and pole angular velocity ensure stability under extreme conditions.

This enhanced strategy aims to maintain the simplicity and effectiveness of Strategy 2 while incorporating minor adjustments to improve robustness and adaptability.
